=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# firewall screen-blocklist ------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Mock: The Firewall screen. web-01.example.net runs Debian 13.$
# ufw inactive, its saved rules denying 198.51.100.0/24 on 22$
# before allowing 22: whether the session's own address is among$
# them is not established, so Enable refuses (ufw.ErrBlocks; P-$
# 33 (3)).$
$
# UFW Firewall Configuration ###################################$
$
  [ ] Firewall             Not Configured inactive$
$
# ufw ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] Installed            Yes$
  [ ] Status               Inactive$
  [+] Incoming policy      Deny$
  [ ] At boot              No$
$
# SSH ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  [::]:22              Not filtered$
   -  0.0.0.0:22           Not filtered$
$
# Rules --------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] 22/tcp from 198.51.100.0/24$
      Deny Saved$
  [+] 22/tcp$
      Allow Saved$
  [+] 22/tcp (v6)$
      Allow Saved$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Enable firewall      Let SSH through, deny the rest$
   2) Application Profiles Add, remove, apply$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0-2 or q]:$
$
$

